1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:35,910
[Camia] <i>Now isn't the time</i>
<i>to give up. Keep fighting.</i>

4
00:00:35,994 --> 00:00:37,620
[Lily] <i>Take justice into my own hands?</i>

5
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:40,206
<i>If that's what they want,</i>
<i>then I might just give it to them.</i>

6
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,624
<i>What's your plan now, Boss Jaguar?</i>

7
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:43,418
<i>The Ardientes have become more powerful</i>

8
00:00:43,501 --> 00:00:45,086
<i>with Red Dragon on their side.</i>

9
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,672
[henchman 2] <i>Shouldn't we be</i>
<i>joining their group now?</i>

10
00:00:47,756 --> 00:00:50,216
<i>Don't you worry. We'll bring them down.</i>

11
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,302
[Arnaldo clapping] <i>Great acting, everyone.</i>

12
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:55,847
[Helena] <i>One day, I'll pay you back</i>
<i>down to the last cent.</i>

13
00:00:55,930 --> 00:01:00,685
<i>We don't know the exact location</i>
<i>of the damn treasure.</i>

14
00:01:00,769 --> 00:01:02,729
[Arnaldo] <i>The only way to the treasure</i>

15
00:01:02,812 --> 00:01:05,023
<i>is through Grandma's princess.</i>

16
00:01:05,106 --> 00:01:08,777
[Helena] <i>I'm going to make you</i>
<i>the protector of my hidden wealth.</i>

17
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:10,820
<i>Just guard it with your life.</i>

18
00:01:10,904 --> 00:01:15,158
[Julio] <i>I know the right person</i>
<i>who can spy on your mother.</i>

19
00:01:15,241 --> 00:01:17,368
[Noel] <i>We couldn't get the court</i>
<i>to release a search warrant.</i>

20
00:01:17,452 --> 00:01:19,579
<i>Wasn't the evidence we presented enough?</i>

21
00:01:19,662 --> 00:01:20,914
<i>I am not a vigilante.</i>

22
00:01:20,997 --> 00:01:23,792
<i>It's my job to make sure</i>
<i>the law is enforced.</i>

23
00:01:23,875 --> 00:01:26,878
[Lily] <i>If the law enforcers</i>
<i>can't do anything about it,</i>

24
00:01:26,961 --> 00:01:29,672
<i>then I guess we'll have</i>
<i>to do things my way.</i>

25
00:01:29,756 --> 00:01:31,841
[Diego] <i>Once we get our hands</i>
<i>on Helena's fortune,</i>

26
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:33,843
<i>we can't surrender it to the authorities.</i>

27
00:01:33,927 --> 00:01:35,345
<i>The Ardientes are in power,</i>

28
00:01:35,428 --> 00:01:37,096
<i>and I'm sure they'd all just get it back.</i>

29
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:41,267
<i>We'll destroy all of Helena Montoya's</i>
<i>illegal businesses.</i>

30
00:01:41,351 --> 00:01:42,185
[Diego] <i>From now on,</i>

31
00:01:42,268 --> 00:01:45,522
<i>we'll face every single challenge</i>
<i>in our lives together.</i>

32
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:47,524
[Lily] <i>We'll face everything together.</i>

33
00:01:47,607 --> 00:01:48,900
<i>Just the two of us.</i>

34
00:01:53,238 --> 00:01:54,656
-[Helena] Emilia.
-Yes, Mama?

35
00:01:54,739 --> 00:01:57,367
Survey the area, and make
necessary adjustments

36
00:01:57,450 --> 00:01:59,661
to increase security, okay?

37
00:01:59,744 --> 00:02:01,830
Yes, Mama. I'll make sure that
even the devil himself

38
00:02:01,913 --> 00:02:04,707
won't be able to find
or steal your fortune.

39
00:02:04,791 --> 00:02:06,459
-Very good.
-Bye, Mama.

40
00:02:09,212 --> 00:02:10,922
-[Emilia] Let's go.
-[car engine starts]

41
00:02:15,885 --> 00:02:17,887
[suspenseful music playing]

42
00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:21,432
[ominous music]

43
00:02:23,268 --> 00:02:24,310
Yes, Governor.

44
00:02:24,894 --> 00:02:27,272
Did Emilia just leave the house?

45
00:02:28,606 --> 00:02:30,900
-Yes, Governor. I'll follow her.
-Good.

46
00:02:32,235 --> 00:02:34,863
Now, get me my money.

47
00:02:49,627 --> 00:02:50,628
[chuckles]

48
00:02:52,922 --> 00:02:53,923
[exhales]

49
00:03:02,891 --> 00:03:04,017
[commander] The Madam's here.

50
00:03:15,278 --> 00:03:16,279
Commander.

51
00:03:16,696 --> 00:03:19,949
[commander] Madam Emilia.
Madam Helena said you'd be here.

52
00:03:20,033 --> 00:03:22,785
That's right. I'm here
for the routine inspection.

53
00:03:22,869 --> 00:03:24,412
-So, shall we begin?
-Yes, ma'am.

54
00:03:24,495 --> 00:03:25,538
-Let's go inside.
-Great.

55
00:03:25,788 --> 00:03:27,790
[suspenseful music playing]

56
00:03:36,257 --> 00:03:37,800
[commander] You two, guard the gate.

57
00:03:37,884 --> 00:03:38,885
[goon] Yes, boss.

58
00:03:48,895 --> 00:03:52,607
Ma'am, we're keeping this place
on 24-hour surveillance

59
00:03:52,690 --> 00:03:55,109
with a total of 25 guards on duty.

60
00:04:00,615 --> 00:04:01,616
Okay.

61
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:04,535
Where's my mother's money pit?

62
00:04:04,619 --> 00:04:07,622
Ma'am, it's a bit further ahead.

63
00:04:08,873 --> 00:04:09,958
Oh, is that so?

64
00:04:10,041 --> 00:04:12,043
Then I will have to ask
my guards to get my shoes

65
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:13,836
because I can't walk in these heels here.

66
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,421
-[commander] No problem.
-Mike.

67
00:04:15,505 --> 00:04:17,340
-[Mike] Yes?
-Please go get my shoes.

68
00:04:23,012 --> 00:04:24,889
[tense music playing]

69
00:04:36,734 --> 00:04:38,736
[action music playing]

70
00:04:50,498 --> 00:04:53,543
[commander] Madam,
here's the site's control room,

71
00:04:53,876 --> 00:04:54,919
and there's the money pit.

72
00:05:00,133 --> 00:05:02,427
[Emilia] So all of my mother's
wealth is in there?

73
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:03,344
Yes, Madam.

74
00:05:04,887 --> 00:05:05,888
[sighs]

75
00:05:06,264 --> 00:05:08,850
You know, I know you have
enough men to guard this.

76
00:05:08,933 --> 00:05:12,520
But what if they just send
a rain of bullets your way?

77
00:05:12,603 --> 00:05:15,398
What if someone poisons you all?
What's going to happen, then?

78
00:05:15,481 --> 00:05:18,276
How are you gonna be able
to protect this property

79
00:05:18,359 --> 00:05:20,778
and my mother's money from intruders, huh?

80
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:22,405
It'll be near impossible for anyone

81
00:05:22,488 --> 00:05:23,906
to even attempt to enter, Madam.

82
00:05:23,990 --> 00:05:26,826
Uh-uh. That's the reason why I'm here.

83
00:05:26,909 --> 00:05:29,954
We'll tighten the security of this place,

84
00:05:30,038 --> 00:05:31,581
and I'll make sure

85
00:05:31,664 --> 00:05:34,542
it'll really be impossible for
any intruders to get in here.

86
00:05:35,293 --> 00:05:36,377
Yes, Madam.

87
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,421
Okay.

88
00:05:49,057 --> 00:05:50,058
Hmm.

89
00:05:53,770 --> 00:05:55,855
Well, you have good facilities here.

90
00:06:12,246 --> 00:06:16,501
My freedom is for the people of Ardiente.

91
00:06:17,919 --> 00:06:20,630
And for my dearest Julio.

92
00:06:22,131 --> 00:06:25,635
-Viva Ardiente!
-[all] Viva Ardiente!

93
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:29,180
Once again, to our friends in the media,

94
00:06:29,263 --> 00:06:30,431
thank you very much for coming,

95
00:06:30,515 --> 00:06:35,103
and once again, I present
to you, Helena Montoya.

96
00:06:35,853 --> 00:06:39,232
And don't be surprised that soon,

97
00:06:39,732 --> 00:06:45,655
she will be Helena Montoya-Ardiente.

98
00:06:46,614 --> 00:06:49,575
[dramatic music playing]

99
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:55,581
-Viva Ardiente!
-[all] Viva Ardiente!

100
00:06:55,665 --> 00:06:57,250
[applause]

101
00:07:06,843 --> 00:07:08,970
[suspenseful music playing]

102
00:07:17,895 --> 00:07:21,524
It's good we parked here.
We won't be spotted here.

103
00:07:21,607 --> 00:07:23,359
Things will be tough if we're caught.

104
00:07:24,902 --> 00:07:27,405
-Ready.
-Let's go.

105
00:07:33,453 --> 00:07:34,579
Are you okay back there?

106
00:07:37,915 --> 00:07:40,918
[sensual music playing]

107
00:07:56,934 --> 00:07:57,935
Get dressed.

108
00:08:10,364 --> 00:08:12,366
[sensual music playing]

109
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:47,485
[suspenseful music playing]

110
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,288
Wait. Wait.

111
00:09:01,165 --> 00:09:02,375
A car's coming.

112
00:09:08,381 --> 00:09:11,092
Bingo. Emilia's car is parked here.

113
00:09:11,634 --> 00:09:13,970
That means Helena
Montoya's wealth is in here.

114
00:09:14,053 --> 00:09:15,763
Colonel. Security's tight.

115
00:09:16,013 --> 00:09:19,475
I can see that. I'm not stupid.
But we have no choice.

116
00:09:20,393 --> 00:09:21,978
[exhales] Security will
really be tight in there

117
00:09:22,061 --> 00:09:23,771
because she's hiding billions in there.

118
00:09:23,854 --> 00:09:25,398
We don't have the time for surveillance.

119
00:09:25,481 --> 00:09:27,483
The governor told us to just strike.

120
00:09:27,567 --> 00:09:28,818
We can't let anyone get their hands

121
00:09:28,901 --> 00:09:30,528
on Helena Montoya's wealth before we do.

122
00:09:30,611 --> 00:09:31,487
So, boys…

123
00:09:31,571 --> 00:09:33,030
[gun loading]

124
00:09:33,114 --> 00:09:34,365
Get ready for battle.

125
00:09:40,871 --> 00:09:42,248
That's Magbanua!

126
00:09:43,874 --> 00:09:45,751
What are Julio's men doing here?

127
00:09:50,881 --> 00:09:52,675
Madam, it looks like we have visitors.

128
00:09:52,758 --> 00:09:54,176
We should get more men.

129
00:09:55,511 --> 00:09:56,512
No need.

130
00:09:58,055 --> 00:10:01,434
It's time to give them my little surprise.

131
00:10:02,643 --> 00:10:03,811
Calm down, friends.

132
00:10:04,228 --> 00:10:07,440
We're with Mrs. Emilia Ardiente.
She's inside, right?

133
00:10:07,523 --> 00:10:09,817
Just wait here, sir.
We'll just verify that with her.

134
00:10:09,900 --> 00:10:11,736
-Okay.
-[grunting]

135
00:10:15,948 --> 00:10:18,159
-[screaming]
-[grunting]

136
00:10:19,535 --> 00:10:21,787
Diego, we can't let the Ardientes

137
00:10:21,871 --> 00:10:24,540
take Helena's fortune first. Let's hurry.

138
00:10:26,042 --> 00:10:28,044
[action music playing]

139
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,761
Be on your guard.

140
00:10:37,094 --> 00:10:38,095
[exhales]

141
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:40,598
Let's go.

142
00:10:45,936 --> 00:10:48,898
[tense music playing]

143
00:11:13,881 --> 00:11:15,341
[gunshots]

144
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:22,932
How did that happen?

145
00:11:24,266 --> 00:11:27,186
How did Magbanua
enter the place just like that?

146
00:11:29,063 --> 00:11:30,856
And where are the other guards?

147
00:11:31,148 --> 00:11:33,317
It's impossible no one's
guarding the site.

148
00:11:33,734 --> 00:11:35,403
[Julio] Thank you. Thank you.

149
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:36,946
-[Helena] Thank you very much.
-[Julio] Thank you.

150
00:11:37,029 --> 00:11:38,406
-Thank you very much for coming.
-Thank you.

151
00:11:38,489 --> 00:11:39,824
[Julio] Thank you. Thank you.

152
00:11:39,907 --> 00:11:44,120
Thank you to all of you.
Thank you for taking time today.

153
00:11:44,203 --> 00:11:45,955
Thank you. Thank you to everyone.

154
00:11:46,038 --> 00:11:49,125
Go ahead. A couple more pictures. Yes.

155
00:11:49,208 --> 00:11:50,960
[camera shutters clicking]

156
00:11:51,043 --> 00:11:51,961
There you go.

157
00:11:54,755 --> 00:12:00,428
[whispers] Helena, if you like
being called my first lady,

158
00:12:01,053 --> 00:12:04,390
maybe you should also learn to play along

159
00:12:05,391 --> 00:12:09,270
and pretend that you love me.

160
00:12:09,353 --> 00:12:11,897
[whispers] Why don't you dream on, Julio?

161
00:12:12,606 --> 00:12:17,236
You know that I don't love you.
I want you to be my partner.

162
00:12:17,319 --> 00:12:22,616
You deal with the politics,
while I run the syndicate.

163
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:26,370
We will be the most powerful
couple in the land.

164
00:12:27,496 --> 00:12:28,914
You know what, Helena?

165
00:12:29,623 --> 00:12:33,836
No matter what you say,
I still love you so much.

166
00:12:34,503 --> 00:12:38,299
Even if I know you're hiding
something from me.

167
00:12:39,633 --> 00:12:44,305
I know you've got
this hidden wealth somewhere.

168
00:12:45,055 --> 00:12:49,059
And word on the street is
that you've got billions

169
00:12:49,143 --> 00:12:51,896
tucked away in a secret place.

170
00:12:53,022 --> 00:12:56,817
Just be thankful that I'm only
asking for half of that.

171
00:12:56,901 --> 00:12:57,902
[giggles]

172
00:13:00,112 --> 00:13:01,864
-Go straight ahead.
-Yes, sir!

173
00:13:02,573 --> 00:13:03,908
-[explosion]
-[men scream]

174
00:13:05,784 --> 00:13:06,785
[groans]

175
00:13:06,869 --> 00:13:09,288
[laughing]

176
00:13:09,371 --> 00:13:12,041
Emilia, good job.

177
00:13:13,501 --> 00:13:14,835
-[Lily] Are you okay?
-[Diego] I'm fine.

178
00:13:14,919 --> 00:13:18,255
Let's stay here for now
until the situation dies down.

179
00:13:19,965 --> 00:13:21,967
-[Helena] Well…
-Thank you very much. You can go now.

180
00:13:22,051 --> 00:13:24,220
-Thank you. Thank you.
-Please go over there.

181
00:13:24,303 --> 00:13:25,429
Thank you.

182
00:13:25,513 --> 00:13:27,806
-Thank you.
-Keep dreaming, Julio.

183
00:13:28,974 --> 00:13:30,267
Dream on.

184
00:13:30,768 --> 00:13:34,730
And catch me and my money if you can.

185
00:13:36,982 --> 00:13:37,983
Helena.

186
00:13:40,236 --> 00:13:42,530
I always charge with interest.

187
00:13:43,864 --> 00:13:46,283
It might be too much for you.

188
00:13:48,869 --> 00:13:49,912
[fire blazing]

189
00:13:50,955 --> 00:13:51,914
[groans]

190
00:14:12,643 --> 00:14:15,020
[commander] Madam Emilia.
You have to leave.

191
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:18,023
Of course, I am leaving, Commander.

192
00:14:18,107 --> 00:14:20,276
Because I can't wait to hear
my father's voice

193
00:14:20,359 --> 00:14:24,363
once I tell him that I've caught
him and his stupid men.

194
00:14:24,446 --> 00:14:25,614
But first…

195
00:14:28,659 --> 00:14:29,743
[phone rings]

196
00:14:31,453 --> 00:14:32,538
Magbanua?

197
00:14:32,621 --> 00:14:34,665
[phone rings]

198
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:37,084
Emilia?

199
00:14:37,167 --> 00:14:40,337
Governor. A landmine blew up at the site.

200
00:14:40,421 --> 00:14:43,299
Hello, Mama. Papa's men

201
00:14:43,382 --> 00:14:44,550
<i>and Col. Magbanua are here.</i>

202
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:47,052
-They tried to raid us.
-What?!

203
00:14:47,887 --> 00:14:49,889
[ominous music]

204
00:14:52,516 --> 00:14:53,934
[tutting]

205
00:14:55,227 --> 00:14:57,438
Sir… We didn't get the money.

206
00:14:59,398 --> 00:15:02,484
[dramatic music playing]

207
00:15:08,908 --> 00:15:09,909
[exhales]

208
00:15:17,917 --> 00:15:19,126
You bastard!

209
00:15:21,754 --> 00:15:23,923
That was very rude of you.

210
00:15:25,007 --> 00:15:27,009
It's a good thing
the press were gone already.

211
00:15:27,927 --> 00:15:29,553
[dramatic music playing]

212
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:32,765
[goon] Hurry! Get rid of the bodies!

213
00:15:37,811 --> 00:15:39,897
[panting]

214
00:15:43,859 --> 00:15:44,860
Are you okay?

215
00:15:46,862 --> 00:15:49,365
Over there. Let's head there. Come on.

216
00:15:55,371 --> 00:15:57,414
[suspenseful music playing]

217
00:15:59,375 --> 00:16:00,960
The pain will go away eventually.

218
00:16:02,878 --> 00:16:06,882
Someday, I'll be able to look
Jepoy in the eyes and tell him,

219
00:16:07,508 --> 00:16:09,969
"Thank you for your love and betrayal.

220
00:16:11,261 --> 00:16:13,806
Because of that, I became stronger."

221
00:16:14,932 --> 00:16:16,058
But I need time.

222
00:16:16,767 --> 00:16:19,520
You know, one day, you'll meet
someone who'll love you right.

223
00:16:19,603 --> 00:16:21,438
Just look around you.

224
00:16:26,026 --> 00:16:29,405
Don't be silly.
Marlon and I are just friends.

225
00:16:29,488 --> 00:16:30,823
-[chuckles]
-[Arnaldo] Okay.

226
00:16:30,906 --> 00:16:31,907
I guess Arnaldo

227
00:16:31,991 --> 00:16:34,827
isn't just a pastor,
he could be a love guru.

228
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,620
[Arnaldo laughs] You're right.

229
00:16:37,705 --> 00:16:41,375
Actually, if you asked me,
I'd rather live here.

230
00:16:41,917 --> 00:16:45,295
'Cause the more time
I spend with my family,

231
00:16:45,379 --> 00:16:49,174
the more I feel that I'm different.

232
00:16:50,634 --> 00:16:52,720
[Marlon] So that's why you weren't there

233
00:16:52,803 --> 00:16:55,055
when Helena Montoya
met up with the Ardientes.

234
00:16:55,764 --> 00:16:57,474
Yeah. I mean, think about it.

235
00:16:57,558 --> 00:17:01,145
She managed to escape all the
complaints filed against her.

236
00:17:01,603 --> 00:17:03,022
So, I'm sure Lily would feel hurt

237
00:17:03,105 --> 00:17:05,274
if she saw me supporting my family.

238
00:17:05,441 --> 00:17:06,859
You said it.

239
00:17:07,985 --> 00:17:11,405
Anyway, I better get going.
The teachers are waiting for me.

240
00:17:11,488 --> 00:17:12,656
All right. Take care.

241
00:17:16,618 --> 00:17:20,664
-By the way, where's Lily?
-Oh, Lily's with Diego.

242
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:24,334
You know those two.
They don't like losing.

243
00:17:25,377 --> 00:17:27,171
They don't like losing? What do you mean?

244
00:17:27,921 --> 00:17:31,300
They said they would take down
all of Red Dragon's businesses.

245
00:17:33,969 --> 00:17:36,430
They'll try to look
for her hidden wealth too.

246
00:17:37,139 --> 00:17:37,973
You don't say.

247
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:39,725
Excuse me, I'll just follow Anna.

248
00:17:39,808 --> 00:17:40,893
Sure.

249
00:17:41,810 --> 00:17:42,811
[Marlon] Anna.

250
00:17:49,735 --> 00:17:51,695
[ominous music swells]

251
00:18:11,131 --> 00:18:13,133
[suspenseful music playing]

252
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:39,618
[heavy breathing]

253
00:18:46,875 --> 00:18:49,211
[panting]

254
00:18:56,051 --> 00:18:58,929
[suspenseful music playing]

255
00:19:08,147 --> 00:19:10,149
I want to help Lily in her mission.

256
00:19:10,232 --> 00:19:12,276
But first, I'll ask my former colleagues

257
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:14,486
where Red Dragon's secret armory is.

258
00:19:14,736 --> 00:19:16,905
-But what if--
-Camia, please.

259
00:19:17,239 --> 00:19:18,657
I need to do this.

260
00:19:26,123 --> 00:19:28,417
[Helena] Yes, I am a dragon.

261
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:31,420
But you, Julio, you're an anaconda,

262
00:19:31,503 --> 00:19:34,298
acting all nice, calling me first lady.

263
00:19:34,381 --> 00:19:36,425
Meanwhile, you were coiling around me,

264
00:19:36,508 --> 00:19:38,844
so you could strangle and eat me up.

265
00:19:38,927 --> 00:19:41,430
It's because I can't trust you.

266
00:19:41,513 --> 00:19:44,224
You really thought you could
outsmart someone like me?

267
00:19:44,308 --> 00:19:46,935
You know why I helped you
get out of prison?

268
00:19:47,019 --> 00:19:49,605
Because I thought
we were going to be allies.

269
00:19:49,688 --> 00:19:52,691
No! You offered me freedom
because you thought you could

270
00:19:52,774 --> 00:19:56,236
fool me long enough to steal my fortune.

271
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:59,781
Only to find out that
once your tactics failed,

272
00:19:59,865 --> 00:20:01,491
you tell your lackey to do it for you.

273
00:20:01,575 --> 00:20:04,077
That's so low. Even for you, Julio!

274
00:20:04,161 --> 00:20:07,831
Hey, I didn't do it! Magbanua acted alone!

275
00:20:07,915 --> 00:20:09,041
Yeah right, Papa!

276
00:20:09,124 --> 00:20:12,044
Colonel Magbanua wouldn't act
without your orders.

277
00:20:12,127 --> 00:20:15,088
And I was there, remember?
I set the landmine.

278
00:20:15,172 --> 00:20:18,425
Your men fell into my trap.
You fell into my trap.

279
00:20:18,508 --> 00:20:20,969
Shut up, you freeloader!

280
00:20:21,053 --> 00:20:23,472
Stop riding on your mother's coattails!

281
00:20:25,933 --> 00:20:29,811
Everybody, stop, okay?

282
00:20:29,895 --> 00:20:32,606
Grandma, you shouldn't
be angry with Grandpa.

283
00:20:32,689 --> 00:20:34,316
Yes, he wants to be compensated.

284
00:20:34,399 --> 00:20:36,276
But the one who really wants
to steal your wealth

285
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:39,279
and your remaining businesses
is none other than…

286
00:20:39,363 --> 00:20:40,656
[imitates drum sound]

287
00:20:40,739 --> 00:20:41,949
Lily Cruz!

288
00:20:46,912 --> 00:20:48,288
-No.
-Yes.

289
00:20:48,372 --> 00:20:51,041
Lily Cruz can't do that. No!

290
00:20:53,835 --> 00:20:55,295
[whispers] Lily Cruz again?

291
00:20:59,633 --> 00:21:01,802
[dramatic music playing]

292
00:21:18,026 --> 00:21:19,027
This is it.

293
00:21:23,031 --> 00:21:24,950
That's where Red Dragon hides her fortune.

294
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:33,375
We can do this, Lily.

295
00:21:35,919 --> 00:21:38,922
[action music playing]

296
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:46,972
-[mahjong tiles rattle]
-[woman] Hi, sir!

297
00:21:47,055 --> 00:21:49,308
Just enjoy, okay?
Looks like we're going to win.

298
00:21:49,391 --> 00:21:51,560
[man 1] Money, sir? Have a drink.

299
00:21:52,769 --> 00:21:54,021
[woman] Sir, good evening. How many…

300
00:21:54,104 --> 00:21:55,105
[man 2] One.

301
00:21:57,024 --> 00:21:58,900
[woman] Here. Here. This way.

302
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:02,112
[suspenseful music playing]

303
00:22:18,003 --> 00:22:19,421
[guard] Sir, do you have an invitation?

304
00:22:20,630 --> 00:22:22,507
Sir? Sir?

305
00:22:23,884 --> 00:22:25,010
[grunting]

306
00:22:27,888 --> 00:22:29,556
[action music playing]

307
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:39,024
[man 1] Go.

308
00:22:43,070 --> 00:22:44,821
[tense music playing]

309
00:22:50,118 --> 00:22:52,412
[man 2] Hurry. Hurry.

310
00:23:04,132 --> 00:23:05,175
[man 1] That'll do.

311
00:23:08,512 --> 00:23:10,680
We'll just go eat.
You guard while we're gone.

312
00:23:10,764 --> 00:23:12,557
-All right.
-Let's go.

313
00:23:14,518 --> 00:23:16,770
[Ed] Hey, bro. I'll just go on patrol.

314
00:23:16,853 --> 00:23:18,021
[man 2] Sure.

315
00:23:22,859 --> 00:23:23,777
Welcome, sir.

316
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,406
[Jepoy] Get out of here.

317
00:23:28,490 --> 00:23:32,744
-[guard] What was that, sir?
-I said, get out of here!

318
00:23:32,828 --> 00:23:33,703
Why is that, sir?

319
00:23:35,247 --> 00:23:36,248
[grunts]

320
00:23:37,833 --> 00:23:39,876
[people clamoring]

321
00:23:45,757 --> 00:23:46,883
[grunts]

322
00:23:47,342 --> 00:23:48,635
[Jepoy groaning]

323
00:23:49,761 --> 00:23:51,763
[action music playing]

324
00:24:00,147 --> 00:24:01,106
[Ed] Hey! Who are you?

325
00:24:01,189 --> 00:24:02,566
[grunts, groans]

326
00:24:03,900 --> 00:24:04,901
[man] Ed?

327
00:24:12,659 --> 00:24:14,369
[grunting]

328
00:24:19,666 --> 00:24:21,501
[Jepoy groans, grunts]

329
00:24:28,049 --> 00:24:29,801
[groans]

330
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:47,861
[grunts]

331
00:24:49,029 --> 00:24:50,864
[man] Ed, where are you? Are you okay?

332
00:24:53,241 --> 00:24:54,159
Ed?

333
00:24:55,619 --> 00:24:57,078
-[Damian grunts]
-[man grunts, groans]

334
00:25:00,248 --> 00:25:01,249
[groaning]

335
00:25:05,128 --> 00:25:06,129
[grunting]

336
00:25:10,467 --> 00:25:12,552
-[gunshot]
-[women screaming]

337
00:25:19,768 --> 00:25:22,729
[tense music playing]

338
00:25:27,108 --> 00:25:28,360
[screaming]

339
00:25:29,861 --> 00:25:30,987
[Jepoy] Everybody out.

340
00:25:31,071 --> 00:25:32,322
[screaming continues]

341
00:25:40,121 --> 00:25:43,416
-[Jepoy] Go on, get out of here.
-[women] Thank you, sir!

342
00:25:43,500 --> 00:25:45,210
[Jepoy] Go back home to your families.

343
00:25:45,293 --> 00:25:47,712
[suspenseful music swelling]

344
00:25:50,757 --> 00:25:52,092
-Get out!
-[woman screams]

345
00:25:52,175 --> 00:25:55,178
[action music playing]

346
00:26:08,108 --> 00:26:09,109
[grunts]

347
00:26:17,742 --> 00:26:18,535
[grunts]

348
00:26:36,261 --> 00:26:39,264
[suspenseful music playing]

349
00:26:42,559 --> 00:26:43,560
[lighter clicks open]

350
00:26:50,900 --> 00:26:53,903
-[glass shattering]
-[fire blazing]

351
00:27:04,873 --> 00:27:06,124
[fire blazing]

352
00:27:20,096 --> 00:27:21,056
[Helena] <i>Well, I better go.</i>

353
00:27:21,139 --> 00:27:24,059
I have to warn the armory,
the site, and the brothel.

354
00:27:24,142 --> 00:27:25,560
I'm going with you.

355
00:27:26,895 --> 00:27:29,064
[Helena's phone rings]

356
00:27:30,482 --> 00:27:31,483
What?

357
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:34,110
[suspenseful music swelling]

358
00:27:42,118 --> 00:27:43,995
This can't be happening!

359
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:46,331
-What's going on?
-It's Lily Cruz!

360
00:27:46,414 --> 00:27:48,708
She's destroying everything!

361
00:27:50,460 --> 00:27:53,004
I'm going to destroy her!

362
00:27:53,380 --> 00:27:56,174
She can't do this to me.
I'm gonna destroy that witch

363
00:27:56,257 --> 00:27:57,425
with my fangs!

364
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:58,760
No.

365
00:27:59,219 --> 00:28:03,807
If she was able to destroy
your brothel and the armory,

366
00:28:05,058 --> 00:28:08,520
the next thing
she'll destroy is your wealth!

367
00:28:08,603 --> 00:28:09,687
[Emilia] Oh my God!

368
00:28:09,771 --> 00:28:10,980
-[Helena] No!
-Let's go!

369
00:28:11,856 --> 00:28:13,817
[Helena screaming]

370
00:28:13,900 --> 00:28:14,901
The money!

371
00:28:16,778 --> 00:28:17,779
[Emilia sighs]

372
00:28:18,488 --> 00:28:21,282
Okay, I guess I'm coming.

373
00:28:23,451 --> 00:28:25,078
[phone vibrating]

374
00:28:28,748 --> 00:28:29,749
[quietly] Jepoy?

375
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:37,882
Jepoy's burned down the brothel.

376
00:28:40,135 --> 00:28:41,136
Very good.

377
00:28:42,929 --> 00:28:44,931
[tense music playing]

378
00:28:53,356 --> 00:28:55,108
[loud explosion]

379
00:29:00,488 --> 00:29:02,407
[phone vibrating]

380
00:29:06,119 --> 00:29:07,162
[quietly] Uncle Damian…

381
00:29:07,245 --> 00:29:08,246
[Damian] <i>Lily…</i>

382
00:29:08,621 --> 00:29:11,040
Tell Jepoy not to go
to the armory anymore.

383
00:29:11,124 --> 00:29:12,959
I burned it down.

384
00:29:15,128 --> 00:29:16,963
I'm ready to help you out, Lily.

385
00:29:17,630 --> 00:29:19,632
Thank you. Thank you, Uncle.

386
00:29:22,135 --> 00:29:23,178
All right.

387
00:29:27,932 --> 00:29:34,773
[man] Help! Help! Help! Help me!

388
00:29:35,482 --> 00:29:40,904
Help! Help! [coughs] Help!

389
00:29:43,031 --> 00:29:48,912
-Somebody, help me! [coughing]
-Stop yelling! I'll help you!

390
00:29:50,914 --> 00:29:52,040
[man] Help me!

391
00:29:59,798 --> 00:30:01,257
[ominous music]

392
00:30:04,636 --> 00:30:07,764
Uncle Damian's burned down the armory.

393
00:30:10,517 --> 00:30:11,684
Let's finish this.

394
00:30:23,905 --> 00:30:24,823
Let's go.

395
00:30:26,741 --> 00:30:27,742
You ready?

396
00:30:28,868 --> 00:30:29,869
I'll go first.

397
00:30:41,130 --> 00:30:43,049
[suspenseful music playing]

398
00:30:50,431 --> 00:30:51,933
Intruders!

399
00:30:53,309 --> 00:30:54,435
-[grunts]
-[groans]

400
00:30:56,855 --> 00:30:58,773
[man] Riz! Riz, get down here!

401
00:30:58,857 --> 00:31:00,316
We need backup! We're under attack!

402
00:31:01,025 --> 00:31:02,235
[gunshots]

403
00:31:03,862 --> 00:31:04,863
[gunshot]

404
00:31:05,405 --> 00:31:06,406
[man groans]

405
00:31:08,741 --> 00:31:09,617
[men groaning]

406
00:31:10,076 --> 00:31:11,160
Men, let's go!

407
00:31:16,749 --> 00:31:20,503
[gunfire]

408
00:31:27,510 --> 00:31:28,303
[grunting]

409
00:31:35,643 --> 00:31:36,519
[screams]

410
00:31:38,813 --> 00:31:39,814
[groans]

411
00:31:45,820 --> 00:31:47,363
[groaning]

412
00:32:01,127 --> 00:32:03,087
[action music playing]

413
00:32:05,757 --> 00:32:06,758
Diego.

414
00:32:12,764 --> 00:32:13,765
[Lily] The keys…

415
00:32:14,140 --> 00:32:15,350
Get the keys.

416
00:32:26,152 --> 00:32:28,112
[action music playing]

417
00:32:33,117 --> 00:32:34,118
[Diego] Let's go.

418
00:32:41,918 --> 00:32:43,378
[chain clanking]

419
00:32:45,046 --> 00:32:47,048
[gate opens slowly]

420
00:32:48,925 --> 00:32:50,510
Wait. Stop.

421
00:32:52,887 --> 00:32:53,888
Hang on.

422
00:33:00,353 --> 00:33:02,647
We can't just walk in there.

423
00:33:03,856 --> 00:33:07,485
One wrong step,
and it might be the end of us.

424
00:33:09,904 --> 00:33:11,072
-[electric spark]
-Hold on.

425
00:33:11,447 --> 00:33:12,949
It might be easier this way.

426
00:33:13,032 --> 00:33:15,284
[panting]

427
00:33:26,212 --> 00:33:27,922
[tense music playing]

428
00:33:29,507 --> 00:33:30,508
[electric spark]

429
00:33:48,026 --> 00:33:50,069
[action music playing]

430
00:33:50,486 --> 00:33:51,487
[Diego] Follow me.

431
00:33:55,491 --> 00:33:56,909
-Be careful, Diego.
-All right.

432
00:33:58,536 --> 00:33:59,537
[Diego groans]

433
00:34:03,750 --> 00:34:04,751
[Diego groans]

434
00:34:05,585 --> 00:34:06,586
[Diego groans]

435
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:10,089
Lower your head.

436
00:34:10,715 --> 00:34:14,093
[suspenseful music playing]

437
00:34:20,308 --> 00:34:21,434
[Diego] Raise your foot.

438
00:34:23,144 --> 00:34:24,103
[electric spark]

439
00:34:30,109 --> 00:34:31,444
-[Lily groans]
-Be careful.

440
00:34:33,362 --> 00:34:34,363
[Diego] Slowly.

441
00:34:35,740 --> 00:34:36,824
This one's harder.

442
00:34:41,120 --> 00:34:42,121
[Lily] A bit more.

443
00:34:46,667 --> 00:34:48,753
[suspenseful music playing]

444
00:34:52,048 --> 00:34:53,049
[electric spark]

445
00:34:56,135 --> 00:34:57,136
[Diego grunts]

446
00:35:08,606 --> 00:35:12,693
[upbeat music playing]

447
00:35:23,496 --> 00:35:24,497
[Lily exhales]

448
00:35:26,374 --> 00:35:27,458
[Diego] Your turn. Okay.

449
00:35:30,044 --> 00:35:31,045
Diego.

450
00:35:31,546 --> 00:35:32,964
[Diego panting]

451
00:35:35,049 --> 00:35:36,050
[Lily] Wait.

452
00:35:36,634 --> 00:35:38,719
Step back then lower your body.

453
00:35:40,263 --> 00:35:41,264
That's right.

454
00:35:41,889 --> 00:35:42,890
Step back.

455
00:35:45,935 --> 00:35:46,894
[Diego] There you go.

456
00:35:47,478 --> 00:35:48,479
Step back.

457
00:35:49,897 --> 00:35:50,815
Be careful.

458
00:35:50,898 --> 00:35:52,525
You can do it. You're almost there.

459
00:35:53,901 --> 00:35:55,903
[tense music playing]

460
00:36:03,870 --> 00:36:04,912
I'll go down first.

461
00:36:26,058 --> 00:36:29,020
[suspenseful music swelling]

462
00:36:48,456 --> 00:36:49,999
Hey, make it fast!

463
00:36:50,082 --> 00:36:52,835
Do I always have to tell you?

464
00:36:54,253 --> 00:36:55,254
Julio…

465
00:36:57,089 --> 00:36:59,842
Lily Cruz can't get that money.

466
00:37:02,011 --> 00:37:04,138
That money is my whole life!

467
00:37:05,765 --> 00:37:07,099
When you left me,

468
00:37:08,643 --> 00:37:11,354
I devoted all my time to the syndicate.

469
00:37:12,855 --> 00:37:18,027
All the time
I should've spent raising Emilia

470
00:37:18,110 --> 00:37:19,946
went to making that fortune.

471
00:37:24,242 --> 00:37:27,703
If I lose it all, I'll have nothing left.

472
00:37:29,247 --> 00:37:32,792
Everything will be lost! Everything!

473
00:37:38,130 --> 00:37:41,259
[dramatic music playing]

474
00:37:54,230 --> 00:37:55,564
[Diego groans]

475
00:37:57,191 --> 00:37:58,234
[electric spark]

476
00:38:22,258 --> 00:38:23,050
[Lily] Just leave it.

477
00:38:25,052 --> 00:38:27,555
-[Diego] These are enough.
-[Lily] Yeah. Let's go.

478
00:38:28,806 --> 00:38:29,807
[Lily yelps]

479
00:38:29,890 --> 00:38:31,976
[alarm blaring]

480
00:38:38,482 --> 00:38:40,526
[Lily] Let's go. Hurry.

481
00:38:43,154 --> 00:38:44,155
[both groan]

482
00:38:47,366 --> 00:38:48,200
[Lily] Hurry up!

483
00:38:50,244 --> 00:38:51,954
[alarm continues blaring]

484
00:39:00,921 --> 00:39:03,132
[alarm continues blaring]

485
00:39:15,603 --> 00:39:17,063
If we only had more time,

486
00:39:17,146 --> 00:39:20,066
we could've taken
all of Red Dragon's money!

487
00:39:20,900 --> 00:39:22,777
Lily, these are enough.

488
00:39:23,361 --> 00:39:24,236
Let's go!

489
00:39:24,820 --> 00:39:27,406
[alarm continues blaring]

490
00:39:29,658 --> 00:39:30,785
Hold on, Lily.

491
00:39:30,868 --> 00:39:32,578
[tense music playing]

492
00:39:33,371 --> 00:39:36,123
[alarm continues blaring]

493
00:39:40,586 --> 00:39:42,755
-[loud explosion]
-[Helena screams]

494
00:39:43,798 --> 00:39:47,927
[Helena] No! No!

495
00:39:48,552 --> 00:39:50,346
[suspenseful music playing]

496
00:40:00,356 --> 00:40:01,357
[Helena] No!

497
00:40:03,609 --> 00:40:04,610
No!

498
00:40:04,902 --> 00:40:05,903
[cries]

499
00:40:08,114 --> 00:40:10,074
No!

500
00:40:10,866 --> 00:40:12,284
My money!

501
00:40:12,368 --> 00:40:13,786
-[Emilia] Mama!
-My fortune!

502
00:40:13,869 --> 00:40:14,995
[Emilia] Wait! No!

503
00:40:15,079 --> 00:40:16,163
[wailing]

504
00:40:16,747 --> 00:40:17,915
-Mama!
-No!

505
00:40:19,250 --> 00:40:21,794
[Helena wailing]

506
00:40:27,133 --> 00:40:28,134
[Emilia] Mama.

507
00:40:28,551 --> 00:40:31,846
-[Helena wailing]
-[somber music playing]

508
00:40:37,017 --> 00:40:39,228
[fire crackling]

509
00:40:48,904 --> 00:40:52,074
[somber music playing]

510
00:41:02,751 --> 00:41:03,711
[Lily] Hurry!

511
00:41:04,128 --> 00:41:06,005
[suspenseful music swelling]

512
00:41:14,930 --> 00:41:17,600
[upbeat music playing]

513
00:41:18,934 --> 00:41:19,852
Let's go.

514
00:41:23,355 --> 00:41:25,399
[fire blazing]

515
00:41:25,816 --> 00:41:27,485
[somber music playing]

516
00:41:33,949 --> 00:41:35,201
[suspenseful music]

517
00:41:37,286 --> 00:41:40,080
[Julio] <i>I'm mad because I was outwitted.</i>

518
00:41:40,372 --> 00:41:44,251
<i>You bastard! I trusted you!</i>

519
00:41:45,085 --> 00:41:47,379
-<i>And this is how you repay me?!</i>
-[Jepoy groans]

520
00:41:48,130 --> 00:41:48,964
Huh?!

521
00:41:49,924 --> 00:41:52,384
<i>This might convince you to talk.</i>

522
00:41:52,927 --> 00:41:54,887
[screams]

523
00:41:55,262 --> 00:41:57,181
<i>Does it hurt?! Talk!</i>

524
00:41:57,765 --> 00:41:59,266
<i>Hang him upside down!</i>

525
00:41:59,934 --> 00:42:00,851
<i>Now!</i>

526
00:42:03,354 --> 00:42:05,356
[somber music playing]

527
00:42:09,735 --> 00:42:11,070
[Anna sobbing]

528
00:42:14,490 --> 00:42:16,825
<i>Nanny, I couldn't protect you.</i>

529
00:42:16,909 --> 00:42:18,285
[Arnaldo] <i>I can kill you</i>

530
00:42:18,369 --> 00:42:20,829
<i>and make it look like</i>
<i>you committed suicide,</i>

531
00:42:20,913 --> 00:42:22,873
<i>just like what I did to Carlotta.</i>

532
00:42:26,835 --> 00:42:28,254
[Natalie] <i>I missed you, Madrigal.</i>

533
00:42:28,963 --> 00:42:30,047
-Hmm?
-[giggles]

534
00:42:31,131 --> 00:42:32,091
<i>Jepoy?</i>

535
00:42:34,635 --> 00:42:36,845
[Anna crying] <i>I was so stupid to think</i>

536
00:42:36,929 --> 00:42:39,723
<i>you'd be different from other men!</i>

537
00:42:39,807 --> 00:42:42,101
<i>But it turns out you're worse!</i>

538
00:42:43,727 --> 00:42:45,271
<i>In case you've forgotten,</i>

539
00:42:46,230 --> 00:42:49,149
<i>you were mine first.</i>

540
00:42:49,567 --> 00:42:50,568
[Natalie yelps]

541
00:42:51,026 --> 00:42:52,027
[grunting]

542
00:42:52,903 --> 00:42:53,904
[Natalie screams]

543
00:42:59,952 --> 00:43:01,954
[Lily] <i>I've done everything I can.</i>

544
00:43:03,122 --> 00:43:04,915
<i>I put Arnaldo in prison…</i>

545
00:43:05,374 --> 00:43:09,169
<i>And Emilia too.</i>
<i>I took Julio's power from him.</i>

546
00:43:09,253 --> 00:43:11,797
<i>And I've put Red Dragon</i>
<i>behind bars, but what happened?!</i>

547
00:43:12,881 --> 00:43:15,467
<i>Our plans all end up in smoke!</i>

548
00:43:15,551 --> 00:43:18,053
<i>Too many people have sacrificed,</i>
<i>so much for this!</i>

549
00:43:18,137 --> 00:43:19,555
<i>Including their lives!</i>

550
00:43:19,888 --> 00:43:23,183
<i>But for what? After I have them locked up,</i>

551
00:43:23,267 --> 00:43:26,103
<i>they'll walk out scot-free</i>
<i>after a few days.</i>

552
00:43:27,730 --> 00:43:29,732
[dramatic music playing]

553
00:43:33,902 --> 00:43:36,947
To all the monsters in this world!

554
00:43:38,449 --> 00:43:40,993
I hope you all burn in hell!

555
00:43:49,460 --> 00:43:50,919
[loud explosion]

556
00:44:02,931 --> 00:44:04,933
[dramatic music playing]

557
00:44:15,944 --> 00:44:18,322
[engine revving]

558
00:44:32,503 --> 00:44:35,422
[upbeat music playing]

559
00:44:54,233 --> 00:44:57,194
[slow instrumental playing]

560
00:45:20,175 --> 00:45:23,220
Mister, can I have some change?

561
00:45:23,470 --> 00:45:27,850
Spare change, mister.
Miss, spare some change, please.

562
00:45:27,933 --> 00:45:32,771
I'm really hungry. Mister,
can I please have some change?

563
00:45:41,238 --> 00:45:43,073
Hey, this is real money!

564
00:45:44,741 --> 00:45:47,161
Wow! Oh, there's another one!

565
00:45:47,244 --> 00:45:48,912
This is a lot!

566
00:45:51,665 --> 00:45:53,417
It's raining money! Wow!

567
00:45:53,500 --> 00:45:55,961
[woman 1] That's a lot of money!
A lot of money!

568
00:45:56,920 --> 00:45:57,921
[woman 2] Money!

569
00:46:02,259 --> 00:46:03,886
[unintelligible]

570
00:46:06,096 --> 00:46:08,140
[cheering]

571
00:46:14,521 --> 00:46:16,899
We've clipped your wings, Red Dragon.

572
00:46:18,108 --> 00:46:20,068
Now you'll crash right into hell.

573
00:46:20,861 --> 00:46:22,279
Happy landing.

574
00:46:36,084 --> 00:46:38,045
Did you see their smiles?

575
00:46:40,380 --> 00:46:41,548
That's because of you.

576
00:46:43,759 --> 00:46:45,052
You mean the two of us.

577
00:46:45,761 --> 00:46:47,221
We both did this.

578
00:46:50,849 --> 00:46:52,935
And we did the right thing.

579
00:46:53,018 --> 00:46:58,023
We only gave back what
the Ardientes stole from them.

580
00:47:00,067 --> 00:47:02,069
As long as we're together,

581
00:47:02,819 --> 00:47:05,364
nothing will ever stand in our way, Diego.

582
00:47:05,447 --> 00:47:09,451
We will rebuild Poblacion Ardiente.

583
00:47:14,915 --> 00:47:16,917
[romantic music playing]

584
00:47:33,350 --> 00:47:34,977
I think someone's tailing us.

585
00:47:36,019 --> 00:47:37,646
[suspenseful music playing]

586
00:47:50,534 --> 00:47:51,743
Step on it!

587
00:47:52,911 --> 00:47:54,037
[man] They can't get away!

588
00:47:55,414 --> 00:47:58,500
[suspenseful music playing]

589
00:48:13,056 --> 00:48:14,308
[Magbanua] <i>You have to see this.</i>

590
00:48:14,391 --> 00:48:16,935
<i>That happened in the next town.</i>
<i>Someone made it rain money.</i>

591
00:48:17,019 --> 00:48:19,438
<i>My money! My money!</i>

592
00:48:19,521 --> 00:48:20,355
[screams]

593
00:48:20,439 --> 00:48:22,441
<i>-Do you have a plan?</i>
<i>-I do.</i>

594
00:48:22,524 --> 00:48:25,319
<i>We need to drive them out of this town.</i>

595
00:48:25,402 --> 00:48:27,946
<i>That way, we can ensure peace and safety</i>

596
00:48:28,030 --> 00:48:29,323
<i>in Poblacion Ardiente.</i>

597
00:48:29,406 --> 00:48:32,784
<i>I will help you crush Lily Cruz.</i>

598
00:48:32,868 --> 00:48:34,870
[Emilia] <i>I love my family.</i>

599
00:48:36,121 --> 00:48:37,706
[Arnaldo] <i>Are you and Lily</i>
<i>going somewhere?</i>

600
00:48:37,789 --> 00:48:38,832
[Diego] <i>Somewhere special.</i>

601
00:48:38,915 --> 00:48:42,586
[Arnaldo] <i>By special, do you mean</i>
<i>you'll propose to her?</i>

602
00:48:43,587 --> 00:48:46,590
[theme music playing]
